# Cloudflare Pages headers (typikon strict baseline).
#
# This file is a TEMPLATE. typikon-init copies it to a consumer site's root
# as `_headers`, which Cloudflare Pages serves verbatim. Sites edit the
# instance, never this template.
#
# The strict CSP enforced here is load-bearing for the typikon design:
#   - script-src 'self'        — no inline <script>, no third-party JS.
#                                 The CSP-enforce CI gate (Phase 5) fails
#                                 builds containing inline scripts so this
#                                 directive cannot be silently weakened.
#   - style-src 'self'         — no inline <style>, no inline style="..." .
#                                 Same enforcement as scripts.
#   - font-src 'self'          — fonts are self-hosted under /fonts/.
#                                 Blocks Google Fonts and any other CDN.
#   - form-action allowlist    — only the explicit third-party form
#                                 destinations the consumer needs. Edit
#                                 the instance, not this template.
#
# When a consumer adds a third-party form action (a new payment link, a
# new newsletter service), the form-action list grows in the consumer's
# _headers and the change goes through the standard PR flow against that
# consumer site — not against typikon. Typikon's role is to enforce the
# default-deny posture; per-site allowlist deltas are consumer business.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), browsing-topics=(), camera=(), clipboard-read=(), clipboard-write=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), hid=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), payment=(), serial=(), usb=(), web-share=(), xr-spatial-tracking=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; form-action 'self' https://buttondown.com; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; manifest-src 'self'; worker-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

# Long-cache for content-addressable static assets.
# Cloudflare Pages adds the cache-busting query string in production
# automatically; consumers can layer asset-fingerprinting on top later.

/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, immutable
